    "title": "Translating Innovation to Clinic: End-to-End Bioprocess Development and cGMP Manufacturing of N332-GT5 HIV Vaccine Candidate for First-in-Human Trials HVTN144",
    "authors": [
      "Pallerla, S.",
      "Uplekar, S.",
      "Boldog, F.",
      "Paulson, J. C.",
      "Baboo, S.",
      "Yates, J. R.",
